## Risk Assessment

| Risk | Probability | Impact | Mitigation Strategy |
|------|-------------|--------|-------------------|
| Smart contract vulnerability in modular architecture | Medium | High | Multiple independent security audits, formal verification of critical paths, bug bounty program |
| EIP-7702 / EIP-4337 spec changes before finalization | Low | High | Track EIP authors' updates, maintain compatibility layer, phased deployment |
| Passkey hardware incompatibility across devices | Medium | Medium | ECDSA fallback validator always available, device compatibility matrix published |
| Cross-chain storage collision after upgrade | Low | High | ERC-7201 namespacing enforced in CI, upgrade simulation tests on fork |
| Gas price volatility impacting relayer/bundler economics | High | Low | Gas optimization benchmarks per release, configurable relayer/bundler fee models |
| Low ecosystem adoption of new wallet standard | Low | Medium | Partner integration program, SDK tooling, developer incentives |

